# a format 20 project from before cane and the small and large studios were retired (2026-11): T3 cane's "bowed",
# T7 cane's "temple bell" with notes, FX I on studio L, FX II on studio S, and a user preset U3 on cane's "koto". Saved
# by that build, for the retired numbers' test (tests/scenarios/retired.xy). Run by such a build (94e9528): its
# loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v20_cane.xy OUT
wait 300
bpm 103
preset 3 bowed cane
preset 7 temple_bell cane
param 7 send2 50
param 7 volume 90
step 7 1 1 60 100
step 7 1 5 67 100
step 7 1 9 72 100
param 11 engine 8
param 12 engine 6
param 12 e2 40
preset 5 koto cane
usersave 5 3
preset 5 knit_pluck knit
wait 40
expect par3.engine 4
expect par7.engine 4
expect par11.engine 8
expect par12.engine 6
projsave 1 cane_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v20_cane.bin
